  "question": {
    "text": "In a buffer solution having equal concentrations of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> and HB the value of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></msub></math> for <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> is <math><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></math> . The pH of buffer solution is"
